    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$58\\,349.04$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}FV &= PV(1+r)^n\\\\100\\,000 &= PV(1+0.08)^7\\\\\\frac{100\\,000}{(1+0.08)^7} &= PV\\\\PV &\\approx \\$58\\,349.04\\end{align*}$$",
